[[0,1322001,0,104,3,101,"2016-10-03T00:49:57","JuiceTown","",[],"","Scott Adams -- \"Thanks to Trump, today smart people all over the country are explaining to their dumb friends how taxes work\"","https://twitter.com/ScottAdamsSays/status/782636142386569216?lang=en","JuiceTown"],[1,6469497,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-03T02:20:54","Fuzzycrumpkin","",[],"<p>Well that is true most people don't know how taxes work. Spend alittle time playing a city builder and you'll get a better idea, minus of course taxes lost through corruption, or the military budget.</p>"],[1,6470156,0,4,0,4,"2016-10-03T04:17:54","aristotle07","",[],"<p>What trump didn't pay in taxes doesn't concern me. If a company pays zero taxes doesn't concern me. What concerns me is the trillions in misspent federal budget by crooked politicians that concerns me.</p>"],[2,6470195,6470156,0,0,0,"2016-10-03T04:23:15","primar","",[],"<p>But those trillions are just made up of <em>drops in the bucket</em>. Ignore them!</p>"],[1,6471070,0,0,1,-1,"2016-10-03T07:47:09","frankenmine","",[],"<p>The theory that Trump leaked carefully chosen excerpts of his taxes seems logical.</p>"],[1,6482332,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-04T18:17:39","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://tweetsave.com/scottadamssays/status/782636142386569216\">https://tweetsave.com/scottadamssays/status/782636142386569216</a> : </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Scott Adams on Twitter: &quot;Thanks to Trump, today smart people all over the country are explaining to their dumb friends how taxes work.&quot;</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/2YJWHb.gif\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"]]
