ot; and will see how it runs. Edited this submission to reflect that.</p>"],[3,6476738,6476600,1,0,1,"2016-10-03T23:56:03","CANCEL-CAT-FACTS","",[],"<p>Very cool how you are always improving things.</p>"],[1,6475763,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-03T21:35:33","Owlchemy","",[],"<p>I like the new cross post column, it helps to show that many, like myself, do cross post. I generally do so to add content in smaller subs so they don't have that 'dead' appearance for new arrivals. I wouldn't be at all put out if ya deducted the cross posts from the overall total, to show that many post as much, or more original content. Keep up the good job ... this is great! </p>"],[2,6475882,6475763,1,0,1,"2016-10-03T21:52:45","VoatSearch","",[],"<p>Thanks mate! Actually the total is uniques + x/posts, eg yours is 26+4=30. I should add a 3rd &quot;total&quot; column to make that clear.</p>"]]
